I can't stand freeloaders that do nothing all day. #speaker:Bryan #emotion:neutral
What a pathetic life that is. #emotion:annoyed
I'd be ashamed if I were them. #emotion:neutral
->END

=== friend_1 ===
Heya *player*. #speaker:Bryan #emotion:neutral
Better not be slacking off out there on the farm. #emotion:annoyed
Don't make me check in on you. #emotion:neutral
->END

=== friend_2 ===
Business has been slow recently. #speaker:Bryan #emotion:neutral
People should work harder so they have the money for house remodels. #emotion:annoyed
Many of the homes here are hideous. #emotion:neutral
