->END

=== two_hearts_scene ===
Jet for the last time, I'm not going to the inn to waste time with your space friends. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
C'mon grumpelstiltskin, you need to take a load off. #speaker: Jet #emotion: happy
I can take a "load off" when I'm dead. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Wow that was deep. #speaker: Jet #emotion: neutral
In order to be the greatest you must sacrifice pleasure for discipline. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
I'm willing to do anything to refine my craft. #emotion: neutral
Ok Picasso you've lost me. #speaker: Jet #emotion: neutral
Your tiny little monkey brain wouldn't understand. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Ok first of all, I'm honored to have a monkey brain. #speaker: Jet #emotion: happy
Second of all, if you don't take anytime for breaks you'll wilt by 30. #emotion: neutral
Right *player*? #emotion: happy
Leave *player* out of this! #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Wait wilt?  #emotion: neutral
What do you mean by wilt? #emotion: neutral
It happened to my Step Uncle Carl. #speaker: Jet #emotion: neutral
Worked so hard he became as useful as a vegetable. #emotion: neutral
And smelled like vinegar. #emotion: neutral
With no friends. #emotion: neutral
You remind me of a young Carl. #emotion: happy
Wha-? #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
I'm nowhere close to Carl! #emotion: neutral
Not yet. #speaker: Jet #emotion: happy
Stop it! #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Just sayin. #speaker: Jet #emotion: happy
He's got to be speaking nonsense, right *player*?" #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral

* Stay on that grind!
Jet is just peer pressuring you Bryan. #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
Stay on that grind! #emotion: none
Yeah you're just trying to impede on my work! #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
I bet Carl isn't even real! #emotion: neutral
And I will not become a vegetable. #emotion: neutral
Nor smell like vinegar. #emotion: neutral
How does someone even smell like that? #emotion: neutral
Sighhh because he was Carl. #speaker: Jet #emotion: neutral
That's how. #emotion: happy
That doesn't even make any sense. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
I've wasted enough time with this stupid conversation. #emotion: neutral
I'm getting back to work. #emotion: neutral
->DONE
* I'm not sure
I'm not sure... #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
What kind of answer is that? #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
A safe one. #speaker: Jet #emotion: happy
I will not be a vinegar smelling vegetable! #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Not if you come to the inn with me! #speaker: Jet #emotion:happy
I'm this close to making you wish you were never here Jet. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
I wish I wasn't here! #speaker: Jet #emotion: neutral
I'd rather be at the inn! #emotion: happy
Ok fine, if I go to the inn with you for 15 minutes will you shut up? #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
I knew you'd crack! #speaker: Jet #emotion: happy
Onward! #emotion: happy
Hmph. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
->DONE
* You should go to the inn
Jet's right you should go to the inn. #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
What? Why? #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Don't want you ending up like Carl. #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
Aha! See? #speaker: Jet #emotion: happy
You can't be serious right now... #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
It's 2 to 1. #speaker: Jet #emotion: happy
That means you're coming! #emotion: happy
I expected more rationality from you *player*. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
That's what I get for asking a farmer to back me up. #emotion: neutral
Ok grumpelstiltskin, less degrading and more walking. #speaker: Jet #emotion: happy
Hmmph fine but only for 15 minutes. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
And stop calling me that. #emotion: neutral
->DONE
->END

=== four_hearts_scene ===
Make sure not to over bake the dough. #speaker: Jesse #emotion: happy
And don't use too much butter! #emotion: neutral
Alright thanks. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: happy
... #emotion: neutral
Oh hey *player*! #speaker: Jesse #emotion: happy
What brings you here today? #emotion: happy
Yeah w-what uhhh are you doing? #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Are you here to get some baking ingredients? #speaker: Jesse #emotion: happy
Bryan just grabbed some as well. #emotion: happy
Uhhh no I didn't! #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Yes you did! #speaker: Jesse #emotion: neutral
You literally just asked me for baking advice. #emotion: happy
I have no idea what you are talking about! #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
I have no interest or experience in this thing you call baking! #emotion: neutral
Isn't it so cute *player*? #Jesse #emotion: happy
Bryan is an aspiring baker! #emotion: happy
No I'm not! #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
And don't ever call me cute. #emotion: neutral
I'm just a hard working blue collar carpenter getting a drink after a hard days work!
#emotion: neutral
I don't have time to make measely pastries! #emotion: neutral
Then why did you ask for flour, butter, and sugar? #speaker: Jesse #emotion: neutral
It's a new diet I'm trying! #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
To make me stronger so I can work more hours as a manly carpenter! #emotion: neutral
Well then I'd choose something healthier than that cake you're baking! #speaker: Jesse #emotion: happy
Wow look at the time, I got to go home and- #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Bake! #speaker: Jesse #emotion: happy
Goodbye! #emotion: neutral
->END

=== six_hearts_scene ===
It's just not good enough Jet, plain and simple! #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Dude it looked unbelievable! #speaker: Jet #emotion: happy
Mr. Ben almost showed emotion! #emotion: happy
Do you know how hard it is for him to show any emotion? #emotion: neutral
I think he almost cracked a smile! #emotion: neutral
Over a hardwood floor! #emotion: neutral
The color was too light for what Ben asked. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
And it wasn't as smooth as it could be. #emotion: neutral
It's just not good enough at this point. #emotion: neutral
I shouldn't show my face around the settlement as the carpenter. #emotion: neutral
With a sorry job like that. #emotion: neutral
What in the emo type of attitude is that? #speaker: Jet #emotion: neutral
It's not me being emo! #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
You don't understand at all what I'm going through! #emotion: neutral
I have a job to fufill here on Raea! #emotion: neutral
As THE carpenter for the settlement! #emotion: neutral
That means that everyone counts on me to take care of the places they live and work! #emotion: neutral
Bryan you're acting spunky today and it's getting me to feel a certain way. #speaker: Jet #emotion: happy
Is everything a joke to you? #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Depends on the angle of the sun. #emotion: neutral
The legacy of my mentor is on my shoulders! #emotion: neutral
He put his life into this place and his craft! #emotion: neutral
Being mediocre as his successor is not an option. #emotion: neutral
You and *player* don't understand! #emotion: neutral
You never will! #emotion: neutral
First of all, not sure why you had to include *player* into this. #speaker: Jet #emotion: neutral
Second of all, who cares about what your mentor thinks. #emotion: neutral
I'm sure your momma is proud. #emotion: happy
And that's all that matters! #emotion: happy
... #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Get out of my shop. #emotion: neutral
Both of you. #emotion: neutral
... #speaker: Jet #emotion: neutral
C'mon *player*. #emotion: neutral
We gotta bounce. #emotion: neutral
->END

=== eight_hearts_scene ===
Oh hey *player*, I wasn't expecting you. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Hey Bryan taking a break? #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
Ahhh well you could say that I guess. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
... #emotion: neutral
I'm sorry how I treated you the other day. #emotion: neutral
I was just upset at myself for the job I did that day. #emotion: neutral
That doesn't mean it was you or Jet's fault. #emotion: neutral
That's ok Bryan I forgive you. #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
... #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
You're a good friend *player*. #emotion: happy
Forgiving somebody after they treat you like garbage. #emotion: neutral
You're just like Jet. #emotion: neutral
Except Jet always adds a stupid comment along with his acceptance. #emotion: neutral
Hmph... classic Jet. #emotion: happy
... #emotion: neutral
I didn't mean to snap like that. #emotion: neutral
I honestly hate acting that way. #emotion: neutral
Burned many bridges because of it. #emotion: neutral
It's just... #emotion: neutral
Whenever I underperform, I just get so angry and disappointed. #emotion: neutral
I can't help but to feel like I'm disappointing my mentor. #emotion: neutral
He was an legenadry carpenter that dedicated his life to his work. #emotion: neutral
After he got old, he gave the reigns to me being his successor to his shop. #emotion: neutral
Those are enormous shoes to fill. #emotion: neutral
And I'm failing to fill them each and everyday. #emotion: neutral
... #emotion: neutral
I've worked so hard on my craft. #emotion: neutral
To try and be a respectable successor. #emotion: neutral
Because of this, I've definitely shut people out of my life. #emotion: neutral
And yet, after all these sacrifices, #emotion: neutral
It's still not good enough. #emotion: neutral
And I wonder if it'll ever be good enough. #emotion: neutral
... #emotion: neutral
Thank you for your forgiveness today *player*. #emotion: neutral
I'm going to go back to work. #emotion: neutral
Please take care of yourself. #emotion: neutral
->END

=== ten_hearts_scene ===
Oh hey *player* what's up. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: happy
Back on break I see. #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
Haha yeah... #speaker: Bryan #emotion: happy
Trying to take more breaks these days. #emotion: neutral
Jesse says it's better for my health. #emotion: neutral
I believe her. #emotion: neutral
But it's driving me crazy. #emotion: neutral
I didn't know you and Jesse talked. #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
Oh er- well we've been friends since childhood. #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Grew up together as cryo children. #emotion: happy
Cryo children? #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
How do you not know about the cryo children? #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
You were supposed to be part of the Originals right? #speaker: Bryan #emotion: neutral
Well cryo children were the embryos preserved for the trip. #emotion: neutral
Meaning we were frozen on the ship of the Originals. #emotion: neutral
That means our parents were left on earth. #emotion: neutral
Meaning they're already dead at this point. #emotion: neutral
Cryo children are futuristic orphans to put it simply. #emotion: neutral
Jesse and I grew up at the Labaratory. #emotion: neutral
We were fed and educated on a basic level. #emotion: neutral
Then assigned to be mentored for specific jobs that the settlement needed at that time. #emotion: neutral
I was assigned to be a carpenter obviously. #emotion: neutral
That's where I met my mentor.. #emotion: neutral
He was a dedicated man, the hardest worker I've ever met. #emotion: neutral
He was a harsh mentor. #emotion: neutral
But it was important lessons to make me the man I am today. #emotion: neutral
He was the father figure that I never had. #emotion: neutral
That's why it's so important to me to live up to his legacy. #emotion: neutral
To keep this carpentry running in a way that would replicate his legacy. #emotion: neutral
I just want him to be proud of me. #emotion: neutral
That's why I work so hard each and everyday. #emotion: neutral
... #emotion: neutral
Y'know... #emotion: neutral
Despite how obsessed I am with my craft, #emotion: neutral
I have to acknowledge that you are important to me *player*. #emotion: happy
As well as Jesse and Jet. #emotion: happy
You guys genuinely care about me. #emotion: happy
So I baked you a strawberry short cake for you. #emotion: neutral
Yes I- #emotion: neutral
Like baking... #emotion: neutral
That doesn't make me less than a man you know! #emotion: neutral
Just don't tell Jet... #emotion: neutral
He would never let me hear the end of it. #emotion: neutral
Don't eat it in front of me either! #emotion: neutral
I get... Uncomfortable... #emotion: neutral
Anyways I better get back to work. #emotion: neutral
Let me know how the cake tastes. #emotion: happy
->END

